    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4wR5uA4PZrJZtaeU5x8HWLQSJIycknRSJv5hFubs9TE.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>$\\begin{aligned}<br/>& \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{PQ}} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{~b}}=0 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 3(3 \\lambda+5)+2(2 \\lambda+5)-2(-2 \\lambda+4) \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 17 \\lambda=-17 \\Rightarrow \\lambda=-1 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{Q}(3,5,9)<br/>\\end{aligned}$<br/>Let A $(3 \\mu+6,2 \\mu+7,-2 \\mu+7)$<br/>$(3 \\mu+3)^2+(2 \\mu+2)^2+(-2 \\mu-2)^2=68$<br/>$\\Rightarrow \\mu^2+2 \\mu-3=0 \\mu=-3 \\text { or } \\mu=1$<br/>A $(-3,1,13)$ and $B(9,9,5)$<br/>$\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{OA}} \\cdot \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{OB}}=-27+9+65=47$",
